      <activity id="532d996f-cc5e-5ccc-af80-6716b40aec08" activityNameId="0ca60134-e5a8-5a99-b668-2e7e7d71c246" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Furnace, wood chips, hardwood, 1000kW</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Furnace, wood chips, hardwood, 1000kW
Inventory refers to the production of a wood chips furnace 1MW. Composition of the previous inventory was used and updated with the average weight of current wood chips furnaces available in Switzerland.\nTechnology: average technology\nTime period: Time of publications.\nVersion: 1\nSynonyms: In UVEK2018 enthalten\nEnergy values: Undefined\nLocal category: Holzenergie\nLocal subcategory: Heizungssysteme\nUVEK 2022 source file:EcoSpold_furnace_wood chips_1000kW_v0.3_gr_lwa.xml\n\n
Synonyms: In UVEK2018 enthalten; 
UUID: 203dd04a-bb55-3c57-811b-5ddaac241af4
Includes materials, transports and energy used for the fabrication of the furnace, the chimney, the storage silo, the automatic fuel supply and the automatic control technique.
Location: undefined
Technology: average technology
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_203dd04a-bb55-3c57-811b-5ddaac241af4.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
